Language English

Book Altar Ordered No Keep Looped

	Page Explore
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @ExploreAltarViaCell
		
		Prolog "You lean down to look through the hole."
		Button "Reveal"
		
		Text """
			Through the hole you can see there is a room and something standing
			in the middle of it. It looks like someone may be in the room, 
			moving around.
			
			But all you are getting is impressions. It's probably not important.
			
			Remove this Sight token.
		"""
		
		Remove TokenExploreAltarViaCell
		Exit
	End Page Explore
	
	Page Place
		Triggered By @ExploreAltarViaSarah
		
		Text """
			You become more aware of your surroundings. You are in some
			kind of underground chamber. A boy hovers in the air, so lost
			in pain that his face barely looks human. He is surrounded by a
			fearsome glow and is somehow part of it.

			You look around and there is an altar across the room and a man
			standing behind it, arms raised. He is speaking in a language
			you don't recognize. His voice seems amplified. As he finishes
			each line, the gate pulses and makes loud electrical noises. The
			pulses radiate though you like shock waves. Each wave feels like 
			fear.

			A woman lies dead at his feet.

			Sarah speaks loudly over the din, <<The summoning spell is nearly
			complete. I can feel the Ancient One approaching from the other 
			side. We must move quickly.>>
		"""
			
		If goal = goalOpenGate Then Text """
			Suddenly, you snap back and quickly look around. A boy is
			slowly rising up from the ground near you. He shakes with fear and
			you can see him reacting with each pulse, as though he were being
			stabbed. He doesn't look at you.

			Across
			the room is an altar with a man standing behind it. His arms are
			raised and he is speaking in a language you don't recognize.
			His voice seems amplified. As he finishes each line, a 
			shock wave of power emanates from him. Each wave feels like fear
			pulsing through you. 
			
			Sarah speaks loudly over the din, <<The opening spell is nearly
			complete. The boy will be used as material to create the gate.
			We must end this.>>
		"""
		
		If goal = goalFeedGate Then Text """
			{c:EventChosenInvestigator} becomes more aware of their surroundings. It is some
			kind of underground chamber. A boy hovers in the air, so lost
			in pain that his face barely looks human. He is surrounded by a
			fearsome glow and is somehow part of it.

			There is an altar across the room and a man
			standing behind it, arms raised. He is speaking in a language
			you don't recognize. His voice seems amplified. As he finishes
			each line, the gate pulses and makes loud electrical noises. The
			pulses radiate though you like shock waves. Each wave feels like 
			fear.

			A woman lies dead at his feet.

			Sarah speaks loudly over the din, <<The summoning spell is nearly
			complete. I can feel the Ancient One approaching from the other 
			side. We must move quickly.>>
		"""
	End Page Place
	
	Page PlaceAltar
		Add TileAltar, TokenMatthias!, TokenAltarInvestigators, TokenDungeonCellInvestigators
		
		Text """
			Now that you have your bearings, you better understand where you are
			and what is around you. Place the {c:TileAltar} tile.
			
			The man at the altar continues casting his spell. Place a 
			Cult Leader as indicated. This is your cousin
			Matthias.

			{c:ChosenInvestigtor} stands near the boy. Move 
			{c:EventChosenInvestigator} to the altar as indicated.

			Sarah transported the rest of the investigators to the dungeon
			cell. Move your investigator figures as indicated.
		"""
		
		Remove TokenMatthias, TokenAltarInvestigators, TokenDungeonCellInvestigators
	End Page PlaceAltar
	
	Page PlaceNpcs
		If goal = goalOpenGate Then Add TokenLiveWoman!
		If goal != goalOpenGate Then Add TokenDeadWoman!
	
		Add TokenAltarGate!
	
		Text """
			The boy floats in the air. Place the {c:TokenAltarGate} token as
			indicated. This is Matthias's son. Somehow, he <i>is</i> the gate.
			
			A dead woman is chained to the altar, lying at Matthias's feet. Place the
			{c:TokenDeadWoman} token. This is the wife of the man who was
			looking for the healing stone.
		"""
		
		If goal = goalOpenGate Then Text """
			The boy floats in the air. Place the {c:TokenAltarGate} token as
			indicated. This is Matthias's son. If you don't stop Matthias, 
			the boy will soon be the gate.
			
			A woman lies at Matthias's feet. Place the {c:TokenLiveWoman}
			token. This is the wife of the man who was looking for the
			healing stone.
		"""
	End Page PlaceNpc
End Book Altar